  "description": "Just like how the sum of single stitches complete a piece of cross-stitch artwork, stitch by stitch, they are fulfilling their destined love that has been continued from their previous lives!-Here is a very old embroidery classroom that is over 20 years old. \"Can I find the light here if learn this?\" Oh Joowon, a man who seems unfamiliar with this place, appeared in the classroom. Joowon, the grandson of the famous entertainment company chairman, has a sad secret that he can't get an erection even if he sees a beautiful woman after becoming an adult. So, Joowon went to a famous fortune-teller, and the fortune-teller said, \"Do embroidery! And find the light for yourself!\" Can Joowon ever find the light?\n\n(Source: Copin Comics)",
